SY_TALK("n8aPT32PEa4",[[0,["Shri Fatima Puja, St Georges, Switzerland,","14 August 1988."]],[193,["Today we are going to have a  puja of Fatimabi,"]],[198,["who was the symbol of Gruhalakshmi,"]],[203,["and so we are going to have the puja"]],[206,["of the Gruhalakshmi principle within us."]],[212,["As the housewife has to finish every work,"]],[216,["everything in the household, and then she goes for a bath,"]],[220,["in the same way this morning, I had to do lots of things"]],[224,["and then I could come for your puja,"]],[228,["because today the house wife’s jobs were many."]],[231,["So I had to finish them like a good house wife."]],[238,["Now, the principle of Gruhalakshmi"]],[244,["has been evolved and developed by the Divine,"]],[249,["it’s not a human being’s creation"]],[256,["and as you know it resides in the Left Nabhi."]],[262,["The Gruhalakshmi is the one that is represented in the life of Fatima"]],[269,["who was the daughter of Mohammed Saheb."]],[275,["Now She is always born in a relationship"]],[281,["to a Guru, which is of virginity, of purity."]],[290,["So She comes as sister or"]],[294,["She comes as a daughter."]],[300,["Now the beauty of Fatima’s life is"]],[304,["that after the death of Mohammed Saheb,"]],[309,["as usual, there were fanatic people who thought they can take"]],[317,["the religion into their hands"]],[319,["and can make it a very fanatic thing."]],[324,["The attention was not paid so much"]],[327,["towards the ascent of the person."]],[331,["Even Mohammed Saheb has described his son in law in many ways."]],[336,["And He is the only one -"]],[338,["or there’s another incarnation- of Brahmadeva,"]],[344,["who came on this earth. Ali came on this earth,"]],[347,["He was the incarnation of Brahmadeva"]],[349,["and his - another incarnation was Sopandeva","[brother of Jnaneshwara],"]],[355,["which, you can go to Pune,"]],[358,["you can see the temple of Sopandeva there."]],[394,["So we have Ali and his wife Fatima"]],[399,["who incarnated on the principle of the Left Nabhi."]],[408,["She stayed in her house, in her household"]],[413,["and She observed what you call"]],[417,["a kind of a panda","[? Pata: veil]"]],[421,["or niqab as they call it, to cover her face."]],[428,["It is a symbol that a woman"]],[431,["who is a housewife has to"]],[440,["save her chastity by covering her face because"]],[447,["She was a beautiful woman and"]],[452,["They were born in a country which was very, very violent"]],[459,["and She would have been definitely attacked"]],[463,["in case She had not lived in that kind of fashion."]],[467,["As you know, in the time of Christ,"]],[471,["though Mary was Mahalaxmi’s incarnation,"]],[475,["had to be very, very potential personality"]],[479,["and Christ did not want anybody to know what She was."]],[486,["But though She was in the house, She was Shakti,"]],[490,["so She allowed her sons"]],[496,["or actually ordered them"]],[500,["to fight those fanatics"]],[503,["who were trying to deny the authority of her husband."]],[510,["And you know that  Hasan and Hussain, they were killed there."]],[514,["It’s a very beautiful thing how"]],[518,["the Mahalaxmi Tatva of Sita"]],[521,["took a form of Vishnumaya"]],[528,["just to establish the beautiful principle of"]],[538,["a housewife."]],[543,["Now, She was very powerful, no doubt,"]],[547,["and She knew that her children will be killed."]],[552,["But these people are never killed,"]],[556,["they never die nor do they suffer."]],[559,["It’s a drama they had to play to show people how stupid they are."]],[563,["As a result of that,"]],[569,["another system started where they respected saints;"]],[574,["like in India Shiya people respect Auliyas"]],[581,["or we can call them the people"]],[583,["who are Realized souls like Nizamuddin Saheb."]],[587,["Then we have got “Chisti”."]],[591,["We have got, in Ajmer, Hajrat Chisti."]],[597,["All these great Saints were respected by Shiyas."]],[601,["But still they could not transcend"]],[606,["the limits of religiosity."]],[613,["So they also became extremely fanatic."]],[618,["Firstly they would not see to"]],[623,["another religion where they had saints."]],[627,["They would not respect the saints who belonged to another religion"]],[632,["and even when we had a great saint"]],[639,["like Sai Nath of Shirdi, who was a Muslim to begin with,"]],[646,["and it is said that Fatima herself brought him"]],[651,["as a child in her lap and gave him to some lady."]],[657,["We did not deny,"]],[662,["as far as Hindus were concerned,"]],[665,["his saintliness, but the Muslims did not accept it."]],[671,["There's another one who is called Haji Malang, who is very near"]],[675,["Bombay, who was a realised soul."]],[678,["He, too, realised the fanaticism of the Shias."]],[684,["`Shia' word comes from Siya;"]],[687,["in U.P. Sita is called as Siya."]],[692,["Sitaji is called as `Siya'."]],[695,["They also did not realise that there are saints who are not,"]],[702,["so called, Muslims but they are saints."]],[707,["So they could not get out of it."]],[709,["So we have another one called Haji Malang"]],[712,["who was worshipped by Hindus."]],[716,["Some Muslims also go there, no doubt."]],[722,["This Haji Malang"]],[725,["was quite worried about the fanaticism of the Shias,"]],[730,["so he appointed some Hindus to worship him,"]],[735,["just to counter balance."]],[737,["They did all kinds of things."]],[739,["There are many saints like that."]],[743,["I went to Bhopal. There is another big saint who was buried [there]."]],[750,["But his all disciples were just depending on the earnings"]],[756,["of that place, which was very bad. Even"]],[759,["Hazrat Nizamuddin's things are the same way as the Hindus do."]],[764,["They all make an earnings,"]],[766,["I mean it's a kind of a commercial business."]],[771,["So this saint died and was buried there."]],[777,["There were many people who were depending on it."]],[779,["When I went there, I just, by the way, asked them,"]],[784,["'What is your religion?'"]],[787,["So they said 'We are Muslims'."]],[789,["I said what 'Was the religion of that saint who died?'"]],[792,["He said 'Saints have no religions.'"]],[796,["So I said 'Then why do you want to follow religion?","Why don't you follow his religion?'"]],[800,["They have no religions."]],[804,["Even, it is said, in Sanskrit,  the Sanyasis have no religions."]],[809,["They are dharmatita, they go beyond the religion."]],[813,["But as it has happened with every incarnation,"]],[816,["it has happened even with the Shia people, with the Sunnis,"]],[819,["with the Hindus, with the Muslims and everyone,"]],[822,["that they made a fanatic group."]],[826,["Now fanaticism itself is absolutely against religion,"]],[831,["against your innate religion within your-self"]],[835,["because it creates poison."]],[839,["It's a venomous thing."]],[842,["It makes you hate others."]],[845,["When you start hating others,"]],[848,["then it reacts in you as horrible poison"]],[852,["which eats up all that is beautiful within you."]],[860,["Hating any one"]],[863,["is the worst thing that human beings can do, but they can do it."]],[867,["They can do whatever they like.","Animals do not hate any one."]],[870,["Can you imagine? They don't know how to hate."]],[873,["They bite some one because that is their nature."]],[876,["They cut some one because that's their nature."]],[879,["They never hate someone."]],[881,["They may not like someone but this hatred, which is a poison,"]],[885,["is a speciality of human conception"]],[890,["and human absorption. Only human beings can hate."]],[896,["And this horrible thing hatred"]],[900,["was settled between even the Muslims which was not done."]],[905,["This Karbala was not created for hatred, but for love."]],[910,["Everything that was done for love was converted into hatred,"]],[914,["in every religion."]],[918,["Now the worst part of the whole thing is,"]],[921,["that one part which hates thinks the other part is the worst of all,"]],[928,["and the another part thinks that the first part is the worst of all."]],[934,["Under what rule, law or logic they decide -"]],[939,["that is their own lookout. So they club together like that."]],[946,["While this principle of the Gruhalakshmi was specially created"]],[952,["to overcome that hatred,"]],[955,["to subdue that icy stuff called hatred,"]],[961,["to remove, from the minds of the people, hatred -"]],[964,["this Gruhalakshmi principle was created."]],[970,["How? In the family when you have a household,"]],[978,["the Gruhalakshmi principle has to subdue the hatred"]],[985,["between the children, between the husband and the children."]],[992,["But if she herself enjoys her hatred"]],[997,["then how can she subdue it?"]],[1000,["She is the source of that peace which subdues hatred."]],[1005,["Now in India we have joint family [system], you too have"]],[1009,["relations like uncles, aunties, this that."]],[1012,["But the housewife's job is to smooth"]],[1018,["smooth out all angularities of people which create friction."]],[1029,["Now the man has to worship a housewife."]],[1032,["It is said so, 'Yatra Narya Pujyante, Tatra Ramante Devata'-"]],[1036,["'wherever the housewife is respected,"]],[1040,["there only the Gods reside'."]],[1046,["In our country, I, must say credit must go to the housewives"]],[1051,["because we are no good for economics,"]],[1054,["no good for politics, administration. Hopeless."]],[1057,["Men folk are useless,"]],[1058,["they don't know any household work or anything,"]],[1061,["women have kept it to themselves, but our society is first class,"]],[1065,["is maintained by the women of the household."]],[1070,["So the man has to respect the housewife, that's very important."]],[1076,["If he does not respect his housewife, there's no possibility"]],[1080,["of any Gruhalakshmi tattva being maintained."]],[1085,["It's like the preservation of that"]],[1093,["principle of a housewife."]],[1099,["But some men, I mean many of them,"]],[1102,["think that it is their birth right to ill-treat their wives,"]],[1108,["to torture them, to say all kinds of things,"]],[1112,["to be angry,  if she is a good woman."]],[1117,["But if she is a nagger, if she is a bhoot,"]],[1120,["then they are subdued, completely subdued."]],[1122,["If the wife is a bhoot then husband always, sort of,"]],[1126,["tries to please her and be extremely kind to her."]],[1131,["He knows she is a bhoot, after all, you know, be careful"]],[1136,["[you] don't know what time the bhoot will come like a snake on you!"]],[1140,["And if she knows how to nag or to argument,"]],[1144,["then also they are afraid. There's no love,"]],[1146,["they have no love or respect for each other"]],[1149,["but they have an awe or fear."]],[1153,["And they are afraid of such a woman."]],[1156,["Now some women think if they become flirtish then","the husbands are better controlled."]],[1162,["But their basic principle they lose."]],[1167,["The basic shakti that they have, they lose,"]],[1172,["and they land up in difficulties."]],[1176,["So the basic principle of a Gruhalakshmi"]],[1179,["is to respect her chastity,"]],[1184,["to respect her chastity outside, inside."]],[1190,["That is the steadiness of her."]],[1192,["Of course most of the men take advantage of it."]],[1196,["If the wife is docile or obedient,"]],[1200,["they make it a point that they just rule the wife, left and right.","Alright!"]],[1208,["But this woman, the housewife,"]],[1213,["has to know that she is not docile."]],[1218,["She is obedient to her own righteousness,"]],[1224,["to her own virtues, to her own qualities."]],[1230,["If the husband is stupid, alright,"]],[1233,["he's stupid like a child, finished!"]],[1236,["But the husband has to know that he must"]],[1240,["respect, otherwise he is a lost case, he's finished,"]],[1244,["he's good for nothing."]],[1248,["First thing is that he must see"]],[1251,["that the woman in the household is respected as a Gruhalakshmi."]],[1256,["Then the blessings flow."]],[1258,["But in no way he should insult her"]],[1264,["or be unkind to her"]],[1268,["and raise his voice or say things to her."]],[1271,["But the wife has to be the one who is to be respected."]],[1277,["I have so many times said, your wife is dominating,"]],[1280,["give her two slaps on the face, of course, no doubt."]],[1284,["She has not to be dominating,"]],[1287,["she has to remove the dominating forces of others."]],[1292,["She is the source of peace,"]],[1296,["she is the source of joy"]],[1299,["and she is the peacemaker."]],[1302,["If she is the one who creates problems,"]],[1306,["then you can slap her nicely, bring her to her shape, is alright."]],[1312,["So this Gruhalakshmi tattva is mutual."]],[1316,["It doesn't depend only on the wife or husband but both of them."]],[1320,["So once if you are making your wife suffer,"]],[1326,["your left Nabhi can never improve."]],[1333,["Or if you are a bad wife your left Nabhi cannot improve."]],[1338,["Now in the west the problem with women"]],[1342,["is this that they don't realise as to what is their power."]],[1350,["An eighty year old woman also would like to look like a bride."]],[1355,["They do not feel their dignity","and enjoy their dignity within themselves."]],[1360,["They are the queen of the house"]],[1363,["but they want to behave like [a] cheapish, childish,"]],[1367,["young frivolous girl."]],[1370,["They do not feel the dignity of their being,"]],[1374,["they talk too much, they behave in a manner"]],[1379,["that, does not behove a housewife."]],[1383,["Like they'll take out their hands, talk like this,"]],[1386,["as the fisherwomen do, when they sell their fish to someone"]],[1390,["and when they have to fight."]],[1393,["Or they shout sometimes, they shout also, I mean,"]],[1397,["I heard they shout and sometimes they beat their husbands,","that's the limit!"]],[1405,["They start always comparing themselves"]],[1409,["with the husband, to begin with."]],[1411,["Like I am such a rich man's daughter,"]],[1416,["I am from such and such family, my husband is from such a"]],[1419,["low family he has no money,"]],[1422,["nothing, he's not educated, so ill-treat him."]],[1425,["Treat him in a manner that so no respect."]],[1428,["Such a woman will lose all her powers."]],[1434,["Also in her own ways"]],[1439,["she will feel guilty,"]],[1441,["she'll feel guilty because, first of all, nobody has right"]],[1445,["to look down upon any one whatsoever in Sahaja Yoga specially."]],[1451,["Then, to look down upon your husband, is something unbelievable."]],[1458,["He may not be a Sahaja Yogi. Alright."]],[1462,["He may not be up to the point, but by your behaviour,"]],[1466,["by your strength, by everything"]],[1472,["you can save him. But why are you losing yourself"]],[1478,["by dominating others, by strangling others,"]],[1483,["by making your husband a very, sort of a,"]],[1490,["frog in the well."]],[1494,["Telling him, 'Oh, we both are after all we should enjoy."]],[1498,["Lets have our house separately,"]],[1500,["nobody should come in the house'.","Even a rat won't enter that house."]],[1505,["Even to say, 'Oh, these are my children, my husband, myself',"]],[1512,["is the negative of Sahaja Yoga,"]],[1516,["is the negative form of understanding."]],[1520,["These are absolutely absurd things,"]],[1524,["they do not look like, of any Sahaja Yogi or any sahaja yogini."]],[1530,["All this kind of selfishness,"]],[1533,["all this kind of seclusion is against Sahaja Yoga."]],[1540,["But a thing of a housewife is,"]],[1543,["'Oh, now how much should I prepare?'"]],[1547,["For example, 'There will be 50 persons coming.'"]],[1551,["So the husband says 'But only 10 are coming."]],[1553,["Why do you want to have for 50 persons ?'"]],[1556,["'But may be they would like to eat more.'"]],[1559,["'But then why do you have 50 plates?'"]],[1562,["'Maybe they might bring there friends.'"]],[1565,["So she thinks of her generosity."]],[1569,["She enjoys her generosity."]],[1571,["I have known many like that."]],[1573,["Though they are not even Sahaja Yoginis."]],[1578,["They will say 'Will you come, sister in law,"]],[1580,["will you come for dinner?'  'Oh, I am not coming,"]],[1582,["you cook too many things.' 'Not coming?"]],[1585,["No, no, I'll cook very few things but please come.'"]],[1588,["Then she just start thinking immediately."]],[1590,["'What vegetables are available in the market?"]],[1593,["What should I get? What is the best?'"]],[1595,["I mean, I am not their Guru, I am not their mother,"]],[1600,["I am just a relation,"]],[1603,["but they want to express their love through the food,"]],[1607,["they are the giver of food - Annadha . They are the Annapurnas"]],[1613,["and this is one of  the quality,"]],[1616,["the generosity for woman doesn't have"]],[1618,["she is not a sahaja yogini, by any chance. Take it from me."]],[1623,["Husband may be little miserly, doesn't matter,"]],[1629,["but wife has to be very generous"]],[1632,["and sometimes, she secretly gives money,"]],[1636,["not to her own children but to others."]],[1641,["Such beautiful women have to be there in Sahaja Yoga."]],[1647,["But I feel so sorry, sometimes"]],[1651,["that the attack comes from the women of Sahaja Yogi,"]],[1657,["not from the men, on me. I'm a woman myself,"]],[1661,["and I feel shocked that women should attack me like this, for what?"]],[1669,["In Sahaja Yoga there is no domination of any kind"]],[1672,["but all these so called ideas of servility or domination comes"]],[1677,["from the false ideas you have, about your own dignity,"]],[1684,["about your own understanding."]],[1686,["You are not aware of yourself."]],[1690,["You do not know that you are the queen, nobody can dominate you."]],[1695,["Who can dominate the lady, who rules the household?"]],[1702,["If supposing the husband says, 'I don't like this colour!'"]],[1704,["Alright, leave it for a while."]],[1706,["Then somebody will come and say 'What a nice colour!'"]],[1709,["'Ah, such a nice colour, oh, don't change it.'"]],[1713,["The women must understand the men."]],[1717,["They have big eyes. They are not microscopic."]],[1722,["They see everything in a big way, you see."]],[1725,["So today they will say something, tomorrow they will forget about it"]],[1730,["and they don't have microscopic eyes."]],[1732,["They are too above these things."]],[1734,["They are above these things. You must understand that!"]],[1739,["But if he sits on the horse, 'I must also sit on the horse","and fall down."]],[1744,["If he goes for skiing - I'll also go for skiing."]],[1748,["If he develops his muscles - I'll also develop my muscles.'"]],[1753,["It is coming to that point."]],[1756,["I mean women start looking like nothing on earth."]],[1759,["You don't know what sort of women these are with big, big muscles"]],[1762,["without any moustaches."]],[1770,["So this kind of stupid ideas we have."]],[1773,["But there is no subordination of any kind."]],[1775,["You are subordinated to your own dignity,"]],[1778,["to your own chastity, to your own sense of honour"]],[1781,["and, above all, to your righteousness"]],[1785,["because you are in charge of that. The man who is in charge,"]],[1790,["has to look after that side."]],[1794,["How many quarrels you create?"]],[1796,["How can you be quarrelsome","when you are supposed to become the peacemaker?"]],[1801,["Supposing we send two peacemakers"]],[1803,["to some country to make peace and they cut each other's throat,"]],[1808,["what will you say to such a thing?"]],[1812,["You are the one who has to smooth down every thing,"]],[1817,["you have  the one who has to bring such"]],[1822,["expression of love, such sweet things"]],[1829,["that the family itself feels rested in you, secured"]],[1836,["because you are the mother."]],[1838,["The family must feel secured within you"]],[1842,["and this love is your power."]],[1848,["This is your power that you can give love"]],[1851,["and giving love you will find, you will always enrich yourself."]],[1857,["I mean imagine what presents I give compared to what I get."]],[1860,["I don't know I'll have to build another house!"]],[1863,["I am telling them \"Don't give me individual present."]],[1865,["I will not take any individual presents.\""]],[1867,["Now still despite that. I don't know,"]],[1870,["just with love if I get something with care, that love, you know,"]],[1877,["itself manifests and comes back to you like a poetry."]],[1881,["You are some times surprised."]],[1886,["I'll give you one simple example of my own life"]],[1889,["which will tell you how love can work it out."]],[1894,["I was a housewife to begin with and to end with, I think."]],[1898,["And once I was in Delhi,"]],[1900,["my daughter was to be born, so I was knitting something for her,"]],[1905,["sitting outside in the lawn,"]],[1907,["when three persons walked into the house, one lady and two men"]],[1911,["and they came and said, \"See now we are..."]],[1914,["housewife, I am a housewife and these two are,"]],[1917,["one is my husband and he is the friend of my husband"]],[1920,["and he is a Muslim,"]],[1921,["and we have come to you for shelter because we are refugees.\""]],[1925,["I looked at them, they looked very good to Me,"]],[1927,["they were quite alright."]],[1929,["I said, \"Alright you please settle down in my house.\""]],[1932,["So I gave them the outside room which had a kitchen"]],[1935,["and a bathroom and this thing,"]],[1937,["and for the gentleman, I said, \"There is another spare room,"]],[1940,["you can stay there, and husband wife can stay here.\""]],[1943,["In the evening my brother came in."]],[1945,["He started shouting at the top of his voice,"]],[1947,["he said \"What is this?"]],[1949,["You don't know these people, they may be thieves,"]],[1951,["they may be this, they might do this...[UNCLEAR]"]],[1955,["my husband came, he also joined him"]],[1957,["because, you see, they were friends!","He told you"]],[1961,["All men just the same, you see,"]],[1964,["so he said, \"You see, she doesn't understand"]],[1966,["she has kept these three persons here."]],[1968,["God knows, what they are, saying refugees, this thing."]],[1971,["She doesn't know, he's a Muslim, he's a Hindu."]],[1973,["God knows, she's two husbands, one husband\" like that,"]],[1977,["all kind of things."]],[1980,["Next morning they forgot about that."]],[1982,["I said \"Alright. Let them be there for one night. Is alright?"]],[1986,["I can't drag them out today, one night.\""]],[1988,["Next morning they forgot that they where living there."]],[1991,["That's like men!"]],[1992,["First day, such a blasting, such a blasting,"]],[1994,["I said \"Alright, one night. Now don't shout. They will feel hurt."]],[1998,["So let them stay one night, they'll be soothed down.\""]],[2001,["Next morning they went away for their work."]],[2003,["They had no time. It was, you see,"]],[2006,["only on a weekend they become active in the household,"]],[2010,["otherwise they are inactive. So they went away."]],[2014,["It so happened that these people stayed with me for one month."]],[2018,["Then this lady got a job"]],[2022,["and she went away with her husband and this Muslim."]],[2028,["But in the meanwhile there was a big riot in Delhi, very big riot"]],[2033,["Because many Hindus and Sikh people were killed in Punjab."]],[2040,["It had a reflection in Delhi"]],[2042,["and they started killing all the Muslims there."]],[2045,["So, three, four Sikh people and one or two Hindus came to my house"]],[2049,["and they said \"We are told that you have a Muslim staying with you.\""]],[2053,["I said, \"No. How can I have?\""]],[2055,["They said, \"There is a Muslim. We have to kill him.\""]],[2058,["I said \"See I am wearing such a big teeka (bindi),","can you believe it"]],[2061,["that I could have a Muslim in the house?\""]],[2064,["They thought I must be a real Hindu fanatic, you see!"]],[2071,["So they believed me. I said, \"See now,"]],[2074,["if you have to go in my house, you'll go on my dead body"]],[2077,["because I will not allow you!\""]],[2078,["So they felt quite frightened. They went away."]],[2081,["So this fellow heard My things and he came and he said,"]],[2086,["\"I'm surprised. How did you risk your life?\""]],[2088,["I said, \"There is nothing. Nothing.\""]],[2091,["His life was saved."]],[2092,["Now this gentleman, this Muslim gentleman,"]],[2095,["became a great poet called Sahir Ludhianvi,"]],[2100,["and this lady became a great actress,"]],[2103,["Kai nau ahe tenza?","(What is her name?)"]],[2105,["the one who used to act like a mother?"]],[2109,["Ha, Sachadev, Achala Sachadev."]],[2114,["I knew it was, they had become one day and all that."]],[2116,["But I didn't tell anybody about it."]],[2118,["I said \"Now supposing they come to know, I am in Bombay,"]],[2122,["they will just go mad about Me,\""]],[2124,["and I said \"I have no time for all that.\""]],[2126,["So, we started a film centre for the young people,"]],[2131,["to give them some good films."]],[2132,["But it all made into a farce, later on."]],[2135,["They never listened to Me, but whatever it is."]],[2138,["So they said \"We should get this Achala Sachadev to act as a mother\""]],[2142,["I said \"Alright ,but don't tell her"]],[2144,["I have said, I have anything to do with it.\""]],[2148,["So, years had passed, about I think about twelve  years or so."]],[2155,["So they went and told her. So she was fussing like an actress."]],[2158,["\"No, no - how much are you going to pay me? I cannot act free."]],[2160,["Everybody will ask for free. Then how can I give you free."]],[2163,["You will have to give me Sari."]],[2165,["You'll have to give so much money. This thing.\""]],[2167,["They said \"Alright come to the muhurat at least."]],[2169,["Come to the muhurat\", to the beginning,"]],[2170,["big muhurat is the one where you start it."]],[2174,["So she came and I was there. She looked at Me"]],[2178,["and just, you know, she couldn't believe"]],[2180,["that she has seen Me after twelve years."]],[2182,["The tears starting swelling her eyes."]],[2184,["Absolutely she couldn't say anything, just she came and"]],[2187,["fell into my arms"]],[2190,["and she said \"Where were you last all these days?"]],[2193,["I have been trying to trace you out.\""]],[2196,["Then she started describing Me and all."]],[2199,["Then Sahir Ludhianvi was there and he said,"]],[2202,["\"How this Lady is here?\" They said, \"This is Her work.\""]],[2205,["\"Oh God, why didn't you tell us? You see,"]],[2209,["we'll give our lives for Her!\""]],[2211,["And they were all amazed, how they were changed."]],[2213,["\"No money, nothing, I am going to give money for this project."]],[2216,["Nothing doing. \""]],[2217,["See now,"]],[2219,["I was a housewife just an ordinary housewife."]],[2222,["I didn't have so many rights on"]],[2227,["my husband's property, or anything,"]],[2230,["and my brother another dominating fellow,"]],[2232,["both of them put together,"]],[2235,["just were about to kill me that night,"]],[2238,["with their temper and anger. I soothed them down"]],[2242,["and then you know when I told my husband"]],[2244,["and my brother, they were amazed."]],[2247,["I said, \"They are the ones who have become like this"]],[2250,["and see the change,"]],[2251,["how much they have...\","]],[2254,["and they said, \"No more, we are going to say"]],[2257,["no to any charitable institution."]],[2259,["This is the last mistake we have committed!\""]],[2261,["And the whole idea of a..."]],[2267,["earning and money just toppled down."]],[2272,["And she has acted in many films for charity"]],[2276,["and this Ludhianvi also wrote many things for charity."]],[2283,["So a woman can make a man a charitable personality -"]],[2289,["because she herself is charitable."]],[2292,["She has so many beautiful..she's an artist!"]],[2296,["And she can create beauty around her,"]],[2298,["in her household, in her family, in her society."]],[2302,["Everywhere. But no!"]],[2304,["Women want to fight like men. They will have associations."]],[2308,["They would have called that [UNCLEAR]"]],[2316,["[UNCLEAR]"]],[2317,["unions, unions  they will like to have unions to fight for that."]],[2325,["I agree that some of the men have been extremely cruel,"]],[2328,["some of the laws have been extremely cruel, this thing, that thing,"]],[2332,["and that they have to be told."]],[2335,["But this is not the way!"]],[2337,["There is another way of improving these men, who try to"]],[2344,["destroy the women,"]],[2346,["because women have one very great quality that Ganas are with them"]],[2353,["and Shri Ganapati is with them."]],[2356,["He will never side with men if they are chaste"]],[2359,["and do not try to show off their body"]],[2362,["and show off their beauty and want to make,"]],[2365,["sort of, a capital out of it."]],[2371,["Such women are extremely powerful,"]],[2376,["extremely powerful, and they show their valour"]],[2379,["when it comes to anything"]],[2380,["like we had Jhansi ki Rani. She was an ordinary housewife."]],[2384,["She fought the British."]],[2386,["And the British also"]],[2388,["were surprised at her valour and they said that"]],[2391,["we had got Jhansi, alright,"]],[2393,["but the glory goes to the Queen of Jhansi."]],[2399,["Like that we had many, Noorjahan we had,"]],[2401,["we had Ahilya Bai. We had many great women in India"]],[2405,["because of these institutions. Padmini we had,"]],[2409,["Chand Bibi. There's so many women we can mention"]],[2412,["who have been great women, who were housewives."]],[2419,["So the woman's qualities are like the potential of the mother earth"]],[2426,["or potential of any energy."]],[2428,["Like electricity has its potential somewhere else."]],[2431,["You see the lights here, makes no difference,"]],[2434,["one light or two lights, but the potential is important."]],[2438,["So one has to understand that we are potential"]],[2440,["and to preserve our potential we must have the sense of dignity,"]],[2444,["honour and righteousness within ourselves."]],[2447,["Now men must respect their women who are like this."]],[2451,["But men are another stupid stuff"]],[2454,["because they will not respect a woman"]],[2457,["who loves them, who is chaste,"]],[2459,["who is good, who wants them to become collective,"]],[2463,["who wants them to give, who be charitable,"]],[2466,["who wants that Sahaja Yoga should be promoted"]],[2470,["and the one who wants that her husband should be happy"]],[2473,["and joyous and that he should come to Sahaja Yoga as well."]],[2478,["Instead of that they run after some funny, stupid women."]],[2484,["What is there to be so attracted towards bhootish women,"]],[2490,["must be some bhoots in them, I don't know,"]],[2493,["that the way they get attracted."]],[2495,["As a result of all this misbehaviour of men,"]],[2498,["women become very insecure"]],[2500,["and they get insecured. As a result,"]],[2503,["the men suffer and women suffer."]],[2507,["A man who neglects his wife, and treats like that,"]],[2511,["will consequently get blood cancer."]],[2524,["And the woman who behaves like this,"]],[2528,["in this manner and if she ill-treats"]],[2533,["her husband, will get asthma"]],[2537,["or of a very serious type of cirrhosis,"]],[2545,["could be brain damage, could be paralysis,"]],[2550,["could be complete dehydration of the body."]],[2558,["Because left nabhi is so important."]],[2562,["If the left Nabhi is made hectic, as you know"]],[2566,["by your running about and by jumping about and by being hectic,"]],[2571,["that left Nabhi becomes hectic and you develop blood cancer."]],[2576,["I have always seen"]],[2577,["that the women who are thin, their husbands as jittery - why?"]],[2584,["Because the wife is all the time making him run up and down."]],[2586,["\"Do this, do that, you didn't bring this thing for me!"]],[2589,["I had asked you to bring the Coca-cola you didn't bring!"]],[2592,["You didn't do that!\" As if he's the sinner all the time."]],[2595,["And the man becomes jumpy all the time, jumpy."]],[2599,["He gets something for the jumping"]],[2603,["and she gets something for her torturing."]],[2607,["There's no love. There's no joy. There's no happiness."]],[2615,["This so-called figure madness,"]],[2618,["which is now subsiding, thank God. It's coming from America now."]],[2622,["It's subsiding. This figure madness makes you funny."]],[2630,["Women have to be settled down women."]],[2634,["They have to be Grahasthis,"]],[2636,["that is, 'The one who settles in the household'."]],[2639,["Said to be satisfied with her household."]],[2642,["If she is all the time running about,"]],[2644,["she doesn't want to stay in the house"]],[2645,["then she is not a housewife, but she is a maid servant."]],[2652,["There is a saying that there was a lady who was a maid servant,"]],[2657,["and then she was made a housewife"]],[2659,["but she could not stop her running about"]],[2662,["because she was a maid servant."]],[2665,["She doesn't settle in the household."]],[2668,["Now for whom is the household, is not only for herself,"]],[2672,["No, not for her husband, no, not for her children"]],[2675,["but for others to welcome."]],[2678,["Like this Mother Earth has spread all these beautiful things for you"]],[2681,["to come and sit and enjoy."]],[2685,["But is a very common thing, also that in Sahaja Yoga,"]],[2687,["we find that people, after marriage,"]],[2690,["become absolutely engrossed into each other and lose Sahaja Yoga."]],[2696,["Then their children suffer. Their children become fussy, funny"]],[2700,["and disobedient, torturesome."]],[2704,["They have some physical problems also - is a punishment."]],[2710,["Not that I punish this,"]],[2712,["but it is your own nature that punishes - supposing you"]],[2714,["put your hand in the fire, it will burn."]],[2717,["I mean who is punishing? You are punishing yourself!"]],[2723,["Then children become funny."]],[2728,["Just for your family, just for your food,"]],[2730,["just for your household, this selfishness,"]],[2735,["if it crawls up into man, then God save that family."]],[2738,["If it's a woman, its alright, at least a little bit"]],[2742,["but if the man is a gone case,"]],[2748,["that I should have a house, I should have a job,"]],[2750,["I should look after my children, it's for my family."]],[2755,["Our family is not of one man one woman"]],[2760,["but the whole universe is our family."]],[2765,["We are not on our own,"]],[2768,["and if you become arbitrary, and if you become secluded."]],[2772,["I must tell you one thing and warn you today"]],[2775,["that-  those people who will try to seclude themselves,"]],[2778,["a day will come,"]],[2780,["when they will have horrid diseases on them don't blame Sahaja Yoga!"]],[2785,["Sahaja Yoga has it's own beautiful realm of God's Kingdom."]],[2790,["But in the God's Kingdom, you have to be collective."]],[2796,["But a bad wife can create problems because she's..[INAUDIBLE]"]],[2801,["and she'll create a problem she'll form a group of people,"]],[2805,["group of women,"]],[2806,["she'll go on rolling down with her bhoots to everyone."]],[2817,["Or may be she's very conscious of her education"]],[2820,["may be conscious of her position or of her money and all that -"]],[2824,["then also she will try to keep the husband aloof."]],[2831,["Such people have to pay for what they have done."]],[2835,["Not because it is a punishment from God."]],[2842,["So Gruhalakshmi tattva in Sahaja Yoga is very important."]],[2847,["Those people who have got problems after coming to Sahaja Yoga,"]],[2852,["most of them have neglected their Gruhalakshmi principle."]],[2860,["Because Gruhalakshmi, if it goes out, then centre heart catches."]],[2866,["Those women who have tried such tricks,"]],[2870,["should give up immediately because it's very indignified."]],[2873,["Nobody respects such a woman."]],[2877,["It's very true with the leaders' wives and the leaders."]],[2881,["The leader's wife or the leadership"]],[2884,["is a minimal of a minimal of a minimal  of a so-called position."]],[2892,["Most insignificant."]],[2896,["What you got is much higher than this."]],[2902,["If you ask a saint to become a king. He'll say, What?"]],[2908,["You want to put the ocean into a cup?"]],[2916,["Is the minimal of minimal."]],[2918,["Is the lowest of lowest."]],[2920,["Those who think their life is service are another stupid people."]],[2926,["Their life is enjoyment, not service."]],[2931,["But that service itself is enjoyment."]],[2935,["But if you just keep to service."]],[2937,["\"Oh, I am sacrificing, this is my tapasya!\" Finished!"]],[2942,["Then you end up like a tapasvi,","with like a beanstalk [figure] - thin."]],[2948,["You can be used for a cross!"]],[2956,["So, in Sahaja Yoga it is enjoyment but,"]],[2958,["unless and until you have that essence"]],[2962,["of enjoyment into everything, it cannot be an enjoyment."]],[2967,["If you take out the essence from the cane sugar"]],[2973,["or what you call the sugar cane bamboo,"]],[2978,["then what is left?"]],[2981,["In the same way, all the so-called service"]],[2984,["and seva and tapasya"]],[2987,["and all that has no sweetness in it,  finished."]],[2992,["So the essence of all this is sweetness"]],[2996,["and that is generated by women."]],[3001,["But they are very strict. \"Don't spoil this."]],[3004,["Keep this nice, keep that nice.\""]],[3006,["The husband comes home like as if like a criminal, you know."]],[3015,["He has to be like a bull in a china shop, he has to be."]],[3019,["It's a good thing in a way."]],[3022,["Is nice, how he doesn't know anything, is even better for you."]],[3031,["But to make him all the time slave,"]],[3033,["\"Do this! You didn't do this for me! Do that for me!\","]],[3036,["Is not the job of a housewife!"]],[3042,["Her job is like the Mother Earth. Does She complain?","Nothing."]],[3049,["She gives you everything."]],[3050,["So much is the sustenance in [UNCLEAR]. So dignity."]],[3054,["Such powers She has."]],[3056,["What does She care for anybody giving her anything?"]],[3059,["You will be amazed if I tell you today, till today, till yesterday,"]],[3063,["I never asked my husband to buy me anything."]],[3067,["For the first time I asked him to buy me a camera,"]],[3071,["and you see the result, in the evening what he said."]],[3074,["Least expected!"]],[3078,["Never in life-time."]],[3081,["He used to say, \"You must tell me what you want\"."]],[3083,["First time, I said something and see the effect."]],[3085,["Because I've never said to him!"]],[3091,["So such a woman has to be self-satisfied,"]],[3094,["satisfied within herself because she has to give."]],[3097,["The person who has to give, how can she demand?"]],[3100,["She has to give love because she is love."]],[3103,["She has to give all the services."]],[3106,["She has to give all the possessions;"]],[3108,["she has to sooth down. What a responsibility, I tell you,"]],[3111,["what a responsibility!"]],[3114,["More than a Prime Minister, more than any king or anyone,"]],[3117,["is the responsibility of a woman,"]],[3119,["and she should feel proud of it,","that such a responsibility has come to me."]],[3123,["A housewife"]],[3125,["has much more responsibility than a leader of Sahaja Yoga."]],[3129,["But the wives of leaders can be horrid"]],[3135,["because they think they have become leaders."]],[3137,["I mean, this is the minimal of minimum."]],[3139,["I mean it's like, I said, the ocean coming into a little cup."]],[3145,["And their behaviour becomes so funny and absurd, I am surprised."]],[3149,["I was married in a family where we had 100 people living together"]],[3157,["and each one of them adores Me."]],[3161,["If I go somewhere in Lucknow,"]],[3164,["all of them will come from all over to see  me"]],[3166,["but My husband goes, nobody comes to see him.","He always complains."]],[3170,["He's the relation, I am not the relation,","and they come and see me, not him!"]],[3177,["If I had not given them love,"]],[3179,["if I had not given them whatever they wanted"]],[3182,["they would have not come to Me."]],[3185,["So they are the preservers, preservers of others."]],[3190,["They don't have to preserve things for themselves."]],[3195,["And we have many stupid women with us, I tell you,"]],[3198,["many stupid women."]],[3200,["We call them buddhu (idiot) in Hindi language, the buddhus."]],[3206,["Because they don't know what power they have got."]],[3212,["They don't know what responsibility they have."]],[3217,["I'm an example before them."]],[3224,["And this is the very big problem with Me that practically"]],[3228,["I think 60% leaders have horrible wives."]],[3231,["I must say, horrible."]],[3236,["And Sahajayoga goes dhap like that with them."]],[3240,["They can't live in an ashram,"]],[3242,["they will have their food,","the husband must see that they have their food."]],[3245,["But it is they who have to feed everyone,"]],[3248,["everybody has to be looked after and at the end they should eat."]],[3255,["Everybody must get a bed, they must see everybody is sleeping now,"]],[3259,["they must cover all the children, everything, then they must sleep."]],[3265,["But no, they sit down,"]],[3266,["they become mini-matajis or greater-than-matajis."]],[3269,["\"Get me this thing! Get me that!"]],[3272,["Just do that! Do this!\""]],[3279,["They don't know how to cook, most of them."]],[3282,["Every wife of a leader"]],[3286,["has to cook and learn cooking. It's compulsory now."]],[3296,["They have to cook. And with heart."]],[3299,["They should be able to cook and give with love to others."]],[3304,["That's the minimum of Annapurna."]],[3309,["And the husband shouldn't find faults with them."]],[3312,["In the beginning they might make mistakes then encourage."]],[3315,["Encourage their qualities, encourage their goodness,"]],[3318,["encourage their niceness."]],[3321,["Also I have seen, some very good ladies"]],[3323,["who were taking very active life in Sahaja Yoga."]],[3326,["After marriage they are lost."]],[3328,["Husbands are also supposed to be Sahaja Yogis - lost."]],[3333,["Sometimes they appear, sometimes if I am there they come,","otherwise they are not there."]],[3338,["Today I was asking Arneau,","he told Me so many of them are like that here."]],[3343,["That means there's something wrong with the husbands"]],[3347,["because before marriage they were better off."]],[3351,["So how much it is important, a Gruhalakshmi Principle within us,"]],[3356,["for us to be together,"]],[3358,["to us to grow together, to feel the togetherness,"]],[3361,["all the time, the oneness that is within us."]],[3364,["So yesterday, as I told you, that I'll tell you about"]],[3368,["the Ragas we have."]],[3370,["Ra is energy."]],[3373,["Ga is in Sanskrit language ‘Ga - Geti’ (ग गेती )  means 'which penetrates',"]],[3377,["'which moves into everything',"]],[3379,["it's the etheric qualities,"]],[3383,["etheric, into which you see,"]],[3385,["you put anything in the ether and  you can receive it anywhere."]],[3389,["So the Raga, is the energy which goes into ether"]],[3395,["and touches your spirit."]],[3399,["That is the Raga."]],[3401,["And these Ragas, I would say are something like a housewife."]],[3412,["Supposing if you stand with a military band"]],[3416,["you will be fed up, \"left right, left right, left right\"."]],[3421,["But a beautiful melody that's a melodious thing, melody."]],[3426,["And this melody itself is suggestive of a beauty."]],[3432,["The way the housewife decorates the house,"]],[3436,["she smoothes down everyone, makes them feel happy."]],[3440,["then she's looking after everyone."]],[3442,["Everybody knows she is standing there."]],[3444,["Imagine, like a modern style would be, you call"]],[3449,["some people for birthday cake of your child"]],[3453,["and you cut the cake first"]],[3456,["because you are the housewife."]],[3458,["How will it look? It is that ridiculous, I tell you."]],[3463,["The way the housewife always puts forward before everybody else."]],[3466,["They have to be on the back because you have to look after."]],[3472,["Look after all of them,"]],[3475,["and this is what is a Raga is."]],[3480,["It caters to all your angularities."]],[3484,["Supposing a person is very upset and worried,"]],[3488,["comes from office, sits down, puts on a Raga."]],[3491,["It soothes you down."]],[3494,["It makes you settle down."]],[3497,["Like people come home for five days, live like"]],[3503,["I don't know, what to call, not even hotels,"]],[3506,["and live in a tent-like thing"]],[3509,["and the sixth day they are out at the sea"]],[3513,["or they go and stay in a hotel."]],[3515,["Nobody wants to stay in the house"]],[3518,["because there is no Gruhalakshmi principle between the two."]],[3524,["But Raga needs better this  sitting down, settling down."]],[3528,["Unless and until you settle down, you cannot enjoy Raga."]],[3531,["Imagine somebody listening to a Raga when he's a jumpy."]],[3537,["So, one has to settle down"]],[3539,["and that settling down is what is the work of a woman"]],[3545,["who is a housewife,"]],[3547,["and the man has to act, is to settle down."]],[3551,["As I have told you many a times how your left Nabhi goes out"]],[3555,["in the modern times, much more,"]],[3557,["and many children are also born of the women who are hectic."]],[3562,["Is that the wife..."]],[3565,["normally in India before, you see,"]],[3568,["the husband used to get up, have his bath,"]],[3570,["all the time his wife is not with him."]],[3573,["She is cooking for him. She is looking after the children."]],[3576,["All the time sticking on to husband also is a sign of boredom."]],[3581,["Husband gets bored, the wife gets bored,"]],[3584,["then they have a divorce."]],[3586,["So must have other interests like looking after the children,"]],[3589,["household, Sahajayoga, things like that."]],[3592,["Then he comes from the bath, he sits,"]],[3596,["sits on the ground, in India."]],[3599,["Now we are sitting on the tables, all right,"]],[3601,["at least sit on the tables, not on the table, but on the chair."]],[3604,["Then she doesn't tell him at this time \"Why did you do like this?\""]],[3610,["Or  \"This lady was quarrelling\""]],[3612,["or \"I met another lady she was telling me you were this"]],[3615,["and you were that.\" No! She says \"Let him eat his food\"."]],[3619,["That's why in India"]],[3620,["if husband has to show temper he doesn't eat"]],[3623,["his food in the house or he will wash his underclothes himself."]],[3630,["That is how, they show their temper."]],[3632,["So then she fans the husband slowly"]],[3635,["and tells him good things, \"You see, today you know why?"]],[3639,["My son got up and he said \"I love my father very much\"."]],[3644,["He said  \"Really?\" \"Yes, yes, he said, he said so\"."]],[3647,["And husband knows she is telling lies also,"]],[3654,["but you see all nice things, you see,"]],[3656,["and \"I think better your mother is much better now."]],[3660,["I think I'll go and look after your mother."]],[3662,["And your sister is coming."]],[3663,["So I think you are buying a Sari for her.\""]],[3666,["All such nice - nice thing she will talk to him."]],[3668,["So he eats his food nicely then he go washes his hands"]],[3672,["and goes in a bullock cart, not in a car"]],[3675,["where there is a jam, always."]],[3678,["Alright, now the bullock cart is over, the fan is over."]],[3684,["You have to be very fast. Life is fast now."]],[3687,["In this fast thing, as I have told you,"]],[3690,["that on the periphery of the"]],[3693,["wheel you have the speed"]],[3696,["but at the axis it is not.","So the Sahajayogis have to be at the axis,"]],[3701,["and so the husband and the wife,","the left and the right side of a chariot"]],[3706,["have to be on the axis"]],[3708,["and the left is left and the right is right."]],[3712,["Now the women always take more time to get ready."]],[3714,["Not Me, I take less than My husband,"]],[3717,["much less than My husband, but normally. So, that is their habit."]],[3722,["Forget it. Now women have their own habits."]],[3726,["They are women. Women will remain women, men will remain men."]],[3729,["Men must see their watches ten times."]],[3732,["Women might see it once or may be","their watches are lost or out of order -"]],[3737,["if they are real women."]],[3739,["They are not jumpy like men, they are different type."]],[3742,["But they are women and you are men,"]],[3746,["and God has made men and women."]],[3749,["If it was to make a unisex,"]],[3751,["He would have made unisex, He did not."]],[3755,["So one must accept the sex is which you are born,"]],[3758,["with grace and beauty and dignity - both."]],[3763,["And you must know this is Woman's party!"]],[3766,["In India we have these things like, you know,"]],[3770,["I was married in a family,"]],[3773,["very orthodox where they used to even cover the face and all that."]],[3776,["So, one day, the collector, is the friend of My husband,"]],[3779,["so, he told My elder brother-in law that, why not the wife of"]],[3783,["my friend come and see Me."]],[3786,["So he said, \"Of course! of course!\" So just to make it easy for Me"]],[3792,["he took leave from his office and disappeared into another town"]],[3795,["and told his wife that \"See that She goes and sees the collector\"."]],[3799,["See how beautiful it was,"]],[3805,["how beautiful it was,"]],[3809,["and I never felt that he was dominating Me"]],[3812,["because after all that was the system of that family,","alright, its alright."]],[3818,["But for this what you need is pure Intelligence."]],[3823,["If the husband is a dullard he'll bring down his wife."]],[3827,["If the wife is a dullard she'll bring down the husband."]],[3830,["If a woman is very smart, talks well and you know she knows how to"]],[3835,["talk and impress people doesn't mean that she is very intelligent."]],[3839,["I call that person the most intelligent who sees the benevolence,"]],[3847,["the ascent and the ultimate goal."]],[3851,["That person is the most sensitive,"]],[3855,["is the most intelligent."]],[3857,["All other intelligence is avidya, is useless."]],[3861,["Now, on this subject I think I can write a book,"]],[3863,["so, is better leave it to the book,"]],[3865,["and today let us have the puja"]],[3867,["May God Bless You."]],[3869,["Any questions?"]],[3876,["This means, I'll be spending some money!"]],[3881,["I don't know, there's no chance! I don't know when will I spend."]],[3884,["I love to spend, I mean, everybody should love to spend."]],[3887,["That's why the money is for."]],[3888,["Must give to others, you see."]],[3890,["Why the matter is there? Matter is to give to others."]],[3892,["Just enjoy giving others."]],[3895,["So enjoyable, to give something to others."]]]);
